    {
      "name": "list_garmin_workouts",
      "description": "List workouts stored in the Garmin Connect account, most recent first, with each workout's name, sport, and workoutId. Use this to find a workoutId to pass to get_garmin_workout, update_garmin_workout, delete_garmin_workout, or schedule_garmin_workout. Read-only. If no valid session exists, returns a message asking you to run authenticate_garmin rather than throwing.",
